  push: {
    title:pair('Mobile push resource','移动 Push 资源'),intro:pair('JPush, FCM HTTP v1 and APNs token transports, including platform event senders and script .send in stable 1.1.0. Acceptance is not handset delivery. Encrypted APNs widget overview snapshots from the unreleased branch are not stable functionality.', 'stable 1.1.0 支持 JPush、FCM HTTP v1、APNs token 传输，含平台事件和脚本 .send。接受不代表手机送达。未发布分支的 APNs 加密 widget 概览快照不属稳定功能。'),prerequisites:pair('Set up provider app and registered test device in the matching environment. JPush needs app key/master secret; FCM project/RSA service-account JSON; APNs bundle/topic and EC .p8 key plus key/team IDs. Permit HTTPS (APNs HTTP/2). Real sends/device actions require opt-in; use a stub by default.', '准备提供方应用和匹配环境注册测试设备。JPush 需 app key/master secret，FCM 需项目/RSA 服务账号 JSON，APNs 需 bundle/topic、EC .p8 和 key/team ID。允许 HTTPS（APNs HTTP/2）。真实发送/设备动作须 opt-in，默认桩。'),rules:pair('Supply provider jpush/fcm/apns in create plain. JPush requires app_key/master_secret; apns_production defaults false, distribution iOS needs true. FCM needs project_id and service_account as one JSON string with client_email/private_key/token_uri; RSA PEM parsed on save. APNs needs bundle_id, environment exactly sandbox/production and p8_key/key_id/team_id; EC PEM parsed on save. Unused provider fields cannot replace required ones. base_url override: HTTPS, HTTP only loopback; host required, no userinfo/query/fragment, outbound policy enforced. Only use approved compatible stubs/endpoints.', '创建 plain 提供 provider jpush/fcm/apns。JPush 需 app_key/master_secret，apns_production 默认 false，分发 iOS 需 true。FCM 需 project_id，service_account 为一个含 client_email/private_key/token_uri 的 JSON 字符串，保存解析 RSA PEM。APNs 需 bundle_id、精确 sandbox/production 的 environment，以及 p8_key/key_id/team_id，保存解析 EC PEM。无关提供方字段不可替代必需项。base_url 覆盖须 HTTPS，HTTP 仅 loopback，有 host、无用户信息/query/fragment，执行出站策略，只用批准兼容桩/端点。'),plain:{provider:'jpush',app_key:'fixture-app-key',apns_production:false,base_url:'https://push-stub.example.test'},secret:{master_secret:'fixture-master-secret-not-a-credential'},py:'return ctx.resources.demo.send(["fixture-rid-1"], "Fixture notification", title="Reference", extras={"case": "fixture"})',ts:'return await ctx.resources.demo.send(["fixture-rid-1"], "Fixture notification", { title: "Reference", extras: { case: "fixture" } });',rust:['push_send',{registration_ids:['fixture-rid-1'],content:'Fixture notification',title:'Reference',extras:{case:'fixture'}}],operations:pair('Python send(registration_ids,content,title="",extras=None); TypeScript send(registration_ids,content,{title,extras}). Broker accepts 1–10000 IDs per call (stale SDK comments say 1000), batching provider requests. IDs: 1–256 visible ASCII bytes, no whitespace. Nonblank content ≤2000 Unicode characters, title ≤128; extras ≤20 string pairs, keys ≤64 bytes, values ≤256 characters. Provider byte limits still apply: APNs JSON/extras total ≤4096 bytes. Returns {accepted:n,delivery:"accepted-by-provider"}; partial acceptance matters. The script supplies IDs/owns user-device mapping, not automatic project-wide discovery.', 'Python 为 send(registration_ids,content,title="",extras=None)，TS 为 send(registration_ids,content,{title,extras})。代理每调用允许 1–10000 ID（旧 SDK 注释写 1000），按提供方分批。ID 为 1–256 可见 ASCII 字节，无空白。content 非空白 ≤2000 Unicode 字符，title ≤128；extras ≤20 字符串对，键 ≤64 字节、值 ≤256 字符。提供方字节限制仍适用，APNs JSON/extras 共 ≤4096 字节。返回 {accepted:n,delivery:"accepted-by-provider"}，部分接受有意义。脚本提供 ID/维护用户设备映射，不自动发现项目所有设备。'),expected:pair('An approved JPush-compatible stub accepts synthetic fixture-rid-1 and returns accepted:1/delivery:"accepted-by-provider". No delivery assertion or send execution is made here.', '批准的 JPush 兼容桩接受合成 fixture-rid-1 并返回 accepted:1/delivery:"accepted-by-provider"，本页不声称送达，也未执行发送。'),test:pair('Provider validation without handset notifications: JPush validation endpoint; FCM validate_only with dummy token (may obtain OAuth token); APNs invalid-test-token probe. Real outbound/auth events, not schema-only. A validation pass does not establish real token/environment compatibility.', '不通知手机的提供方校验：JPush 校验端点，FCM 虚拟 token validate_only（可能获取 OAuth token），APNs 无效测试 token 探测。仍是真实出站/认证事件，不是仅 schema，成功不证明真实 token/环境兼容。'),failures:pair('resource.push.empty_app_key/empty_master_secret/empty_project_id/empty_service_account/empty_bundle_id/empty_p8_key/empty_key_id/empty_team_id: complete provider fields. bad_service_account_json/key or bad_p8_key: fix material; bad_environment: exact sandbox/production; bad_url/outbound_denied: approved base. Re-register invalid tokens; uncertain timeout can follow acceptance, so blind retry duplicates sends.', 'resource.push.empty_app_key/empty_master_secret/empty_project_id/empty_service_account/empty_bundle_id/empty_p8_key/empty_key_id/empty_team_id 补提供方字段。bad_service_account_json/key、bad_p8_key 修材料；bad_environment 用精确 sandbox/production；bad_url/outbound_denied 修批准 base。无效 token 重注册，超时可能已接受，盲目重试会重复。'),production:pair('Choose environment deliberately, minimize sensitive text/extras, retire invalid tokens and deduplicate sends. Credentials stay platform-side. Removing this resource does not retract notifications/revoke vendor keys; disable callers/events then revoke separately. Do not promise 1.1.0 background widget snapshots.', '有意选环境，减少敏感正文/extras，退役无效 token 并去重。凭据留平台。删资源不撤回通知或撤销厂商 key，应停用调用/事件后单独撤销。不可承诺 1.1.0 后台 widget 快照。'),exposure:'broker',related:['http_api','config','secret']
  }
